WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.303
-As wildfires
and an out-of-control pandemic

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:05.471
continue to rage,
the president and his party

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:08.007
are descending deeper
into lawless authoritarianism.

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:10.510
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:14.580 line:0%
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.949
Donald Trump and his allies
desperately want you to believe

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.217
that, for the last four years,

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:20.653
Joe Biden
has been the president.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.988
For example, last week,
the Trump campaign

00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:24.758
released an ad with the text...

00:00:27.092 --> 00:00:29.596
I mean, he does live here,
but that's about it.

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:32.031
By the same token,
this is Ben Affleck's America

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:34.433
or Cue Card Wally's America.

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:35.868
-Seth, I would love to tell you

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.970
about my healthcare plan.
-No, no, Wally.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.205
And, on "Meet the Press"
yesterday,

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.708
GOP Chairwoman Ronna McDaniel
had this to say

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:44.277
when asked about Trump's
coronavirus failures.

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.479
-You compare us to the rest
of the Western world,

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:48.147
and we have failed.

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:50.749
Is there any way to look at this
and compare to the Western world

00:00:50.749 --> 00:00:54.920
and say that we've done better
than other countries?

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.791
-I will just tell you right now,
if Democrats were in charge,

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:59.091
if Joe Biden had his way --

00:00:59.091 --> 00:01:01.160
Go look at his statements
in January,

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.163
when he said the president
was being xenophobic

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:04.563
-He's not the president.
-and hysterical

00:01:04.563 --> 00:01:06.165
for closing the borders
to China.

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:07.200
-He's not the president.
-No, no no.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.501
He was running for president

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.737
and he had the same data
and the same information.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:14.040 line:0%
So I think it's disgusting
to take a crisis in our country

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.175 line:0%
and try and lay it
at the feet of the president.

00:01:16.175 --> 00:01:19.212
-First of all, I'm not sure
Biden did have the same data

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.980
and information
as the sitting president.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.882
With that said, Trump probably
never looked at that data,

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:24.751
so, maybe that's what she means?

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:27.453
"Joe Biden has access
to cable news and Twitter,

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:28.954
just like the president."

00:01:28.954 --> 00:01:31.224
And I'm not sure
it is disgusting

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:33.593
to take a crisis in our country
and lay it at the feet

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.428
of the guy who's in charge
of our country.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.896
What other options do we have?

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:38.864
Should we just leave
a negative review

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:41.300 line:0%
on Chipotle's Yelp page?

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.902 line:0%
That hardly seems fair.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.137
Seriously, you guys
are the party

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.638
of personal responsibility,

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:47.840
except when the person
is Donald Trump.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:50.609 line:83%
On Friday, we recorded
1,200 new deaths in one day.

00:01:50.609 --> 00:01:52.912 line:85%
Canada recorded zero.

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:54.713
Yet, when she was asked
about Trump's failures,

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:57.216
McDaniel blamed the death toll,
nonsensically,

00:01:57.216 --> 00:01:58.518
on increased testing.

00:01:58.518 --> 00:01:59.719
-How do you account
for the fact that it's

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.254
the United States of America
that accounts

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:03.789
for 25% of the world's deaths?

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:05.758
-Well, we do have more testing.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:07.660
-Wait, what?!

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.629
Do you think the tests
are killing people?

00:02:10.629 --> 00:02:12.965
How deep are they
pushing those swabs?

00:02:12.965 --> 00:02:14.701
We test people to see
if they're sick,

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:15.868
not to see if they're dead.

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.169
You know that, right?

00:02:17.169 --> 00:02:18.871
Have you ever watched
an episode of "Law &amp; Order"?

00:02:18.871 --> 00:02:20.807
When the M.E. shows up,
it's to determine

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:23.910
cause of death, not,
"Are they going to be okay?"

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.412
Trump has catastrophically
mishandled the worst crisis

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:28.548
in this country
in over 100 years

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.449
and he's lied to the
American people about it,

00:02:30.449 --> 00:02:33.586
as we learned last week from the
bombshell Woodward tapes.

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:36.455
But it's not just that
he's an incompetent liar.

00:02:36.455 --> 00:02:39.425
He's also actively
making it worse.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:42.195
Last night, he held his first
indoor rally in months

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:45.398
in Nevada, In violation of the
state's COVID restrictions.

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:46.999
There were lots of chanting

00:02:46.999 --> 00:02:48.868
and very little
social distancing

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:51.270
and many refused
to wear masks at all.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:54.140
If you were actively trying
to get people sick,

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:55.575
this is how you would do it.

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:58.177
The only way he could spread
the virus more efficiently is

00:02:58.177 --> 00:03:00.679
to hold a rally
at a meatpacking plant

00:03:00.679 --> 00:03:02.982
and charge one French kiss
for admission.

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:04.550
At his next rally,
there's gonna be one

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:07.320
Make America Great Again Kleenex
that everyone has to share.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.555
[ As Trump ]
Just blow your nose
and pass it around.

00:03:09.555 --> 00:03:11.357
[ Singsong ]
Trump fever!

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.259
We know these events
can seed outbreaks

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:14.760
because it's already happened.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.629
After Trump's
Tulsa rally in June,

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:18.898
