00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:24.603
Even the current director of the
National Institutes of Health,

00:03:24.603 --> 00:03:27.406
Francis Collins, who's normally
very mild-mannered,

00:03:27.406 --> 00:03:30.409 line:0%
had harsh words for how
irresponsible these events are.

00:03:30.409 --> 00:03:32.744
-What do you think
when you see these images

00:03:32.744 --> 00:03:34.247
of an event like this?

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:38.984 line:0%
-It just deeply
puzzles me, Sanjay.

00:03:38.984 --> 00:03:40.453 line:0%
How did we get here?

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:43.823 line:0%
Imagine you were an alien
who landed on planet Earth

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:45.357 line:0%
and you saw that our planet

00:03:45.357 --> 00:03:47.426 line:0%
was afflicted
by an infectious disease

00:03:47.426 --> 00:03:50.863 line:0%
and that masks were an effective
way to prevent the spread.

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:51.898 line:0%
And, yet, when you went around,

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:53.532 line:0%
you saw some people
not wearing them

00:03:53.532 --> 00:03:55.668 line:0%
and some people wearing them
and you tried to figure out why

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:58.538 line:0%
and it turned out
it was their political party.

00:03:58.538 --> 00:03:59.972 line:0%
And you would scratch
your head and think

00:03:59.972 --> 00:04:01.640 line:0%
this is just not
a planet that has

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:03.710 line:0%
[ Laughing ]
much promise for the future.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:05.411
-Well, I mean, at this point,
I'm guessing

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:07.980
most intergalactic ports
have travel advisories

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:09.948
warning aliens not
to come to Earth.

00:04:09.948 --> 00:04:12.384
And what a terrible time
for an alien to land here,

00:04:12.384 --> 00:04:13.886
if they were lookin'
for any kind of attention.

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:15.721
[ Robotically ]
I am Bylor from Grammax Seven.

00:04:15.721 --> 00:04:17.523
What?!
Okay, good for you.

00:04:17.523 --> 00:04:19.692
Just put on a [bleep] mask
while you're here, okay?

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:21.527
If an alien landed
on planet Earth right now,

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:23.696
they'd take one look around,
shift into reverse,

00:04:23.696 --> 00:04:26.198
and hightail it outta here
like a family of tourists

00:04:26.198 --> 00:04:27.933
who took a wrong turn
on vacation.

00:04:27.933 --> 00:04:29.902
"There's a deadly virus
and the sky is orange?

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:31.337
You know what, kids?
Get back in the sponsorship.

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:32.605
I don't care!

00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:34.440
You can pee
when we get to Venus!"

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.142
As controversial as this
may sound to Republicans,

00:04:37.142 --> 00:04:40.613
the fact is Donald Trump
is currently the president

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:42.147
And he's overseen
an era of crisis

00:04:42.147 --> 00:04:43.649
unprecedented in our lifetimes.

00:04:43.649 --> 00:04:44.784
It's hard to watch

00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:46.285
what's happening
in our country right now

00:04:46.285 --> 00:04:49.321
and avoid the conclusion
that everything is broken --

00:04:49.321 --> 00:04:51.891
rich ghouls are dismantling
the post office,

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.092
kids can't go to school,

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:55.128
there are massive lines
at food banks,

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:58.063
we're nearing
200,000 COVID deaths;

00:04:58.063 --> 00:05:01.467
and, in the West,
millions of acres have burned,

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:02.969
the air itself
is a health hazard

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:06.071
and the sky is literally orange.

00:05:06.071 --> 00:05:07.673
I mean, holy [bleep]

00:05:07.673 --> 00:05:09.641
This looks like a scene
