00:05:33.999 --> 00:05:35.535
I feel like I'm in a YA novel.

00:05:35.535 --> 00:05:38.370
The only thing we're missing is
Forest Whitaker in a mech suit,

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.239
tellin' us we have
