00:05:40.239 --> 00:05:41.874
to restore balance
to the universe.

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:43.742
[ As Whitaker ]
Schools are closed,
the sky is orange,

00:05:43.742 --> 00:05:45.144
and Tom Brady is
on the Buccaneers.

00:05:45.144 --> 00:05:47.446
We must reset the timeline.

00:05:47.446 --> 00:05:50.116
The only upside of 2020 is
