for millions of Americans,

00:09:41.313 --> 00:09:43.515
what was the president
of the United States doing?

00:09:43.515 --> 00:09:46.952
He was watchin' hours
and hours of Fox News.

00:09:46.952 --> 00:09:49.688
-I watch some of the...shows.

00:09:49.688 --> 00:09:50.890
I watched Liz McDonald.

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.091
She's fantastic.

00:09:52.091 --> 00:09:54.960
I watched Fox Business.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:59.931
I watched Lou Dobbs last night,
Sean Hannity last night,

00:09:59.931 --> 00:10:03.035
Tucker last night, Laura.

00:10:03.035 --> 00:10:06.071
I watched "Fox &amp; Friends"
in the morning.

00:10:06.071 --> 00:10:08.274
You watch these shows,

00:10:08.274 --> 00:10:10.843
you don't have to go
too far into the details.

00:10:10.843 --> 00:10:12.911
They cover things that are --

00:10:12.911 --> 00:10:14.647
It's really an amazing thing.

00:10:14.647 --> 00:10:15.981
-My God, man, you just named

00:10:15.981 --> 00:10:17.950
like six different
Fox News shows!

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:20.652
Were you stuck overnight
in an airport?

00:10:20.652 --> 00:10:22.755
No one should watch that much
Fox News in one sitting.

00:10:22.755 --> 00:10:24.890
That's like telling your doctor
you smoke once a day,

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.493
but you cram 50 cigarettes
in your mouth at once.

00:10:27.493 --> 00:10:29.061
Also, can we go back
to this comment?

00:10:29.061 --> 00:10:31.097
-You watch these shows,

00:10:31.097 --> 00:10:33.966
you don't have to go
too far into the details.

00:10:33.966 --> 00:10:36.468
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.
Heaven forbid we get caught up

00:10:36.468 --> 00:10:38.637
in the details
on our news shows.

00:10:38.637 --> 00:10:39.972
[ As Trump ]
You know what I like
about Hannity?

00:10:39.972 --> 00:10:43.175
Never uses words that are
longer than one syllable.

00:10:43.175 --> 00:10:44.677
Very easy to follow.

00:10:44.677 --> 00:10:46.011
That's the president
of the United States,

00:10:46.011 --> 00:10:47.946
bragging that,
as several states were on fire

00:10:47.946 --> 00:10:49.781
and the death toll
from an out-of-control pandemic

00:10:49.781 --> 00:10:51.283
neared 200,000,
he was sitting

00:10:51.283 --> 00:10:53.452
in front of his TV,
watching Fox News,

00:10:53.452 --> 00:10:56.721
like a grandpa whose Rascal
scooter ran out of batteries.

00:10:56.721 --> 00:10:58.824
[ Gravelly voice ]
Someone push me
into the other room.

00:10:58.824 --> 00:11:00.726
And, when he's not watching Fox,

00:11:00.726 --> 00:11:03.362
he's on Fox, like on Saturday,
when he sat down

00:11:03.362 --> 00:11:04.930
for an interview
with Jeanine Pirro,

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.698
where he threatened
to send federal forces

00:11:06.698 --> 00:11:09.034
to put down protests
after the election,

00:11:09.034 --> 00:11:11.970
falsely claimed shadowy figures
were behind civil unrest,

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:15.441
and celebrated extrajudicial
killings by state forces.

00:11:15.441 --> 00:11:17.309
-Let's say there are threats.

00:11:17.309 --> 00:11:19.811
They say that they're
gonna threaten riots,

00:11:19.811 --> 00:11:22.181
if they lose on election night.

00:11:22.181 --> 00:11:25.284 line:0%
Assuming we get a winner
on election night.

00:11:25.284 --> 00:11:26.818 line:0%
What are you gonna do?
-We'll put 'em down

00:11:26.818 --> 00:11:28.720 line:0%
very quickly, if we do that.
-How are you gonna do that?

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:29.855 line:0%
-We have the right to do that.

00:11:29.855 --> 00:11:31.857 line:0%
We have the power
to do that, if we want.

00:11:31.857 --> 00:11:33.759 line:0%
Look, it's called insurrection.

00:11:33.759 --> 00:11:35.093 line:0%
The suburbs is gonna be next.
-Yeah!

00:11:35.093 --> 00:11:37.596 line:0%
-Look, the suburbs, the people,
these same protesters --

00:11:37.596 --> 00:11:38.731 line:0%
but they're not protesters.

00:11:38.731 --> 00:11:40.700 line:0%
They're anarchists,
they're agitators,

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:41.834 line:0%
-Who are they?
-and they're rioters.

00:11:41.834 --> 00:11:43.068 line:0%
-Who are they?
-They're people that,

00:11:43.068 --> 00:11:44.436 line:0%
in many cases, are paid.

00:11:44.436 --> 00:11:45.971 line:0%
Now, we sent in
the U.S. Marshals

00:11:45.971 --> 00:11:48.107 line:0%
for the killer

00:11:48.107 --> 00:11:50.942 line:0%
and, in a short period of time,
they ended in a gunfight.

00:11:50.942 --> 00:11:53.645 line:0%
This guy was a violent criminal
-A lotta them out there.

00:11:53.645 --> 00:11:55.814 line:0%
-and the U.S. Marshals
killed him.

00:11:55.814 --> 00:11:57.550 line:0%
And I will tell you something.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.385 line:0%
That's the way it has to be.

00:11:59.385 --> 00:12:02.988 line:0%
There has to be retribution
when you have crime like this.

00:12:02.988 --> 00:12:04.757
-I mean, just listen
to the words he's using --

00:12:04.757 --> 00:12:07.526
retribution, agitators,
insurrection.

00:12:07.526 --> 00:12:09.928
It's like fascist
magnetic poetry.

00:12:09.928 --> 00:12:12.131
And also, no one
is destroying the suburbs.

00:12:12.131 --> 00:12:13.699
What are you talkin' about?
The only thing

00:12:13.699 --> 00:12:16.468
destroying the suburbs
is the proliferation

00:12:16.468 --> 00:12:18.770
of Spencer's gifts
in our nation's malls,

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:20.806
poisoning our children's minds

00:12:20.806 --> 00:12:22.841
with their sexy calendars!

00:12:22.841 --> 00:12:24.910
As a general rule,
I wouldn't trust Jeanine Pirro

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:26.511
as a source of information
on anything,

00:12:26.511 --> 00:12:28.280
since I'm pretty sure
her blood alcohol level

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:31.283
is like 99% white wine spritzer.

00:12:31.283 --> 00:12:35.854
Her show on mute is still louder
than an F-15 taking off.

00:12:35.854 --> 00:12:37.990 line:0%
It's hard to watch this
and avoid the conclusion

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:40.792 line:0%
