a straight-up fascist state

00:12:40.792 --> 00:12:43.128
where the government can put
down protests with violence

00:12:43.128 --> 00:12:45.931
and seek extrajudicial
retribution against suspects.

00:12:45.931 --> 00:12:48.567
Meanwhile, they don't care
if the country crumbles.

00:12:48.567 --> 00:12:50.069
Large parts of the West
are on fire,

00:12:50.069 --> 00:12:52.071
